    "rob2628_s13": "Rob2628 Season 13 Cheat Sheet on D4Builds.gg. Accessed: 2026-05-08.",
    "mekuna_s13": "Mekuna Season 13 guides on Mobalytics (Paladin, Warlock, Sorcerer). Accessed: 2026-05-08.",
